1
00:00:25,330 --> 00:00:28,130
♪Break the chain, erase the curl♪

2
00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:31,090
♪I rise up with my inner pearl♪

3
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:34,190
♪Self-rescue fire burning full♪

4
00:00:34,570 --> 00:00:37,620
♪I'm the master of my rule♪

5
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:40,050
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

6
00:00:40,250 --> 00:00:43,030
♪Calm but full of pearls♪

7
00:00:44,010 --> 00:00:46,010
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

8
00:00:46,220 --> 00:00:49,260
♪I rule my whole own whirl♪

9
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:53,560
=Quite The Girl=

10
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:54,450
(Adapted from the Tomato novel
"Quite The Girl.")

11
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:55,062
(Author: Wo Shafei Kuxin)

12
00:00:55,063 --> 00:00:55,903
=Episode 22=

13
00:01:03,679 --> 00:01:04,560
The thing you wanted.

14
00:01:06,879 --> 00:01:07,799
You can have it,

15
00:01:08,239 --> 00:01:09,280
(From)
but on one condition.

16
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:10,159
What?

17
00:01:11,359 --> 00:01:12,159
I'll be the one

18
00:01:13,239 --> 00:01:14,159
to test the drug.

19
00:01:29,599 --> 00:01:31,280
You've done enough for me.

20
00:01:31,519 --> 00:01:33,120
I won't let you risk yourself again.

21
00:02:05,439 --> 00:02:06,439
(Get over here!)

22
00:02:09,479 --> 00:02:11,080
(Your parents are dead.)

23
00:02:11,439 --> 00:02:13,479
(You eat and live under our roof.)

24
00:02:13,639 --> 00:02:15,680
(Just a stray dog we feed!)

25
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:16,960
(Wretched thing.)

26
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:18,960
(From now on, you sleep here!)

27
00:02:30,719 --> 00:02:31,560
(I'll marry you.)

28
00:02:31,879 --> 00:02:33,439
(No hitting in my family.)

29
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:39,280
(Lu Mingyu,
let me bring back Lu Mingye.)

30
00:03:00,103 --> 00:03:04,423
♪Maybe we met by chance♪

31
00:03:06,646 --> 00:03:09,879
♪One glance, and I fell♪

32
00:03:09,879 --> 00:03:11,240
I'll get you some water.

33
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:13,080
Don't go.

34
00:03:13,107 --> 00:03:15,890
♪The moment we passed by♪

35
00:03:16,255 --> 00:03:19,542
♪My heartbeat lingered in my ear♪

36
00:03:19,879 --> 00:03:21,319
I missed you so much.

37
00:03:21,346 --> 00:03:24,580
♪Your face froze before my eyes♪

38
00:03:25,563 --> 00:03:27,910
♪I'm always here♪

39
00:03:29,139 --> 00:03:31,419
♪Waiting is all I know♪

40
00:03:32,252 --> 00:03:35,759
♪Wherever you go♪

41
00:03:36,826 --> 00:03:38,579
♪Oh, you♪

42
00:03:39,099 --> 00:03:41,219
♪Wherever you are♪

43
00:03:42,225 --> 00:03:44,885
♪Wherever you go♪

44
00:03:45,652 --> 00:03:48,992
♪Wherever you go♪

45
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:50,400
You finally said it.

46
00:03:50,426 --> 00:03:51,832
♪For you♪

47
00:03:52,350 --> 00:03:54,630
♪Wherever you are♪

48
00:03:54,639 --> 00:03:56,719
Add one more rule
to the assistant hiring.

49
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:58,879
Overseas study required.

50
00:03:59,439 --> 00:04:00,199
And,

51
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:02,000
majored in painting.

52
00:04:04,159 --> 00:04:04,960
Xiuming.

53
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:06,199
Why don't you

54
00:04:06,199 --> 00:04:07,759
just say her name?

55
00:04:11,252 --> 00:04:15,572
♪Whenever I recall your silent profile♪

56
00:04:16,646 --> 00:04:20,639
♪Longing fills my empty hours♪

57
00:04:20,639 --> 00:04:21,959
(Okay, got it.)

58
00:04:22,893 --> 00:04:27,286
♪You're used to bearing it alone,
never with a sigh♪

59
00:04:27,319 --> 00:04:28,160
(Zhan Xiang.)

60
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:29,839
(Go to the pharmacy now.)

61
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,519
(Get wound medicine for the office.)

62
00:04:31,519 --> 00:04:34,940
♪I'll be your harbor,
shield you from the rainy sky♪

63
00:04:35,566 --> 00:04:38,446
♪I'm always here♪

64
00:04:39,126 --> 00:04:41,973
♪Waiting is all I know♪

65
00:04:42,586 --> 00:04:46,046
♪Wherever you go♪

66
00:04:46,813 --> 00:04:48,566
♪Oh, you♪

67
00:04:49,086 --> 00:04:51,206
♪Wherever you are♪

68
00:04:52,208 --> 00:04:55,147
♪Wherever you go♪

69
00:04:55,721 --> 00:04:58,533
♪Wherever you go♪

70
00:05:00,105 --> 00:05:02,479
♪For you♪

71
00:05:02,632 --> 00:05:05,059
♪Wherever you are♪

72
00:05:05,493 --> 00:05:09,312
♪Wherever you go♪

73
00:05:09,879 --> 00:05:12,120
What were you looking for last night?

74
00:05:12,399 --> 00:05:13,160
I know.

75
00:05:13,639 --> 00:05:14,800
Lu Qiuliang's heirloom

76
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:16,079
was a fake you made.

77
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:17,560
I need proof.

78
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:19,240
The real will

79
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,800
is hidden

80
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,519
in Mr. Lu's favorite painting.

81
00:05:22,959 --> 00:05:24,160
It's my grandpa's painting.

82
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:26,279
A few years ago,

83
00:05:26,399 --> 00:05:27,600
Lu Qiuliang sold it

84
00:05:27,759 --> 00:05:30,879
to an art firm called Moyun Zhai.

85
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:31,759
Mr. Zhou.

86
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:33,560
(Carry On the Lus)
Could you help me out?

87
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:35,399
Say you'll agree

88
00:05:35,399 --> 00:05:36,959
to be our consultant,

89
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:38,240
but on one condition.

90
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:39,759
We'll bring you a piece of pottery

91
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:41,199
from Moyun Zhai.

92
00:05:42,319 --> 00:05:44,199
So I'm not the only one
who can't let go.

93
00:05:45,662 --> 00:05:47,915
♪Wherever you are♪

94
00:05:48,855 --> 00:05:51,734
♪Wherever you go♪

95
00:05:52,214 --> 00:05:55,166
♪Wherever you go♪

96
00:05:56,685 --> 00:05:59,006
♪For you♪

97
00:05:59,252 --> 00:06:01,645
♪Wherever you are♪

98
00:06:05,559 --> 00:06:09,391
♪Wherever you go♪

99
00:06:12,185 --> 00:06:15,858
♪Wherever you go♪

100
00:06:18,907 --> 00:06:21,580
♪Wherever you go♪

101
00:06:42,240 --> 00:06:43,240
What's the rush?

102
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:48,000
Clear hallucination cycle.

103
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:49,959
Strong emotional amplification.

104
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:52,560
Useful for breaking defenses.

105
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:55,040
Let me add one key point of evidence.

106
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:57,319
This drug makes you spill the truth.

107
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:58,360
Last night...

108
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:01,519
We can skip that.

109
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:02,560
I remember it all.

110
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:09,600
Then, care to explain?

111
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:12,560
Missing your ex in the dead of night

112
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:13,920
is normal.

113
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:15,759
Besides...

114
00:07:16,199 --> 00:07:17,560
My ex has a great body

115
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:19,040
and gets things done.

116
00:07:19,879 --> 00:07:21,680
Hard to forget.

117
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:23,279
Since we still have feelings
for each other,

118
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:25,759
why not give us another chance?

119
00:07:30,279 --> 00:07:32,040
Didn't we do that last night?

120
00:07:32,519 --> 00:07:33,680
Playing with fire

121
00:07:34,319 --> 00:07:35,480
leads to disaster.

122
00:07:36,639 --> 00:07:38,680
I'd like to see you try.

123
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:40,639
I'm greedy.

124
00:07:40,879 --> 00:07:41,959
All...

125
00:07:42,399 --> 00:07:43,439
Or nothing.

126
00:08:27,319 --> 00:08:28,199
Lu Mingyu.

127
00:08:29,279 --> 00:08:30,560
Was this your doing?

128
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:34,000
Don't run!

129
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:35,559
Don't run!

130
00:08:36,240 --> 00:08:37,240
Lu Mingyu...

131
00:08:40,279 --> 00:08:41,000
Don't run...

132
00:08:41,440 --> 00:08:42,399
You witch.

133
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:44,559
You witch... Get back here!

134
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:46,279
Lu Mingyu, stop!

135
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:47,919
Was this your doing?

136
00:08:49,360 --> 00:08:51,440
You witch... Get back here!

137
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:57,320
Wenxin...

138
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:01,240
You came...

139
00:09:04,399 --> 00:09:05,879
Is the medicine ready?

140
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:10,919
Why won't you just stay dead?

141
00:09:13,159 --> 00:09:15,360
Drink this, and you're as good as dead.

142
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:17,559
You'll never seduce my husband again.

143
00:09:17,679 --> 00:09:18,240
Drink it!

144
00:09:18,639 --> 00:09:20,000
You witch!

145
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:20,919
Drink it!

146
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:28,159
Drink!

147
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:32,240
Drink!

148
00:09:32,759 --> 00:09:34,000
Drink the whole thing!

149
00:09:34,360 --> 00:09:35,879
Every last drop!

150
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:36,720
Drink!

151
00:09:37,039 --> 00:09:38,399
How did my mom die?

152
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:51,639
How?

153
00:09:59,200 --> 00:10:00,720
I killed her.

154
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:02,159
What can you do about it?

155
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:04,200
I poisoned her medicine.

156
00:10:04,519 --> 00:10:06,039
That homewrecker!

157
00:10:06,159 --> 00:10:06,559
She deserved it!

158
00:10:06,559 --> 00:10:07,519
Du Wenxin!

159
00:10:08,759 --> 00:10:10,879
My mom never even
looked at your husband.

160
00:10:11,320 --> 00:10:14,159
He was the one chasing after her!

161
00:10:14,759 --> 00:10:16,799
Your pathetic jealousy

162
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:19,039
is just a lie you tell yourself!

163
00:10:19,159 --> 00:10:20,120
Wake up!

164
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:21,000
Lu Mingyu!

165
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:22,960
I hate your face!

166
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:25,039
A woman

167
00:10:25,639 --> 00:10:27,080
who blames another woman

168
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:28,600
for everything her husband did.

169
00:10:28,919 --> 00:10:31,360
That's truly shameless and pathetic.

170
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:32,200
Shut up!

171
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:33,039
The day she died,

172
00:10:33,039 --> 00:10:34,519
I should've killed you, too!

173
00:10:34,519 --> 00:10:36,320
I'm sick of looking at your face!

174
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:37,399
Auntie!

175
00:10:40,679 --> 00:10:42,039
So Wanwei's death

176
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:44,000
wasn't from her car crash.

177
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:45,240
It was you!

178
00:10:45,759 --> 00:10:47,360
I killed her.

179
00:10:47,919 --> 00:10:49,240
That woman's dead.

180
00:10:49,679 --> 00:10:51,360
You must be heartbroken.

181
00:10:51,399 --> 00:10:53,320
You murderous psycho!

182
00:11:30,400 --> 00:11:35,020
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

183
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:41,400
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

184
00:11:44,500 --> 00:11:49,190
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

185
00:11:50,310 --> 00:11:55,260
♪Chimes and cicadas have loved so long♪

186
00:11:57,650 --> 00:12:03,830
♪A love letter written in song♪

187
00:12:04,530 --> 00:12:09,340
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

188
00:12:11,850 --> 00:12:17,780
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

189
00:12:18,550 --> 00:12:24,570
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

190
00:12:24,830 --> 00:12:31,750
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

191
00:12:32,710 --> 00:12:35,240
♪Close your eyes and count♪

192
00:12:35,280 --> 00:12:37,880
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

193
00:12:37,880 --> 00:12:44,380
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪
